# Code review

Przed `git push`:

1. `/review-bugbot` na branch changes.
2. `PYTHONPATH=src python -m unittest discover -s tests`
3. Bypass hook: `SKIP_PUSH_REVIEW=1 git push`

Hooki: `gate-push.sh` (ask), `gate-destructive.sh` (deny force main/master/dev / reset --hard).
Reguły Bugbota: `.cursor/BUGBOT.md`.
